One record per chain, named after the `--rpc-url` alias. Folio runs on one
network, so there is one file: `robinhood-mainnet.json`. DeployFactory.s.sol
writes the record for the chain it ran on and CreateToken.s.sol updates it with
the most recent launch. Commit it once it exists, so the frontend and the
interaction scripts read the same address.

A record with an empty `factory` is a placeholder for a chain nothing has been
deployed to yet: `lib/contracts/deployment.ts` reads it as "no factory here"
and the site reports itself as unconfigured rather than sending a transaction
into the void. Deploying fills it in.
